# LoveHelper 外部 skill 拷贝(有独立 LoveHelper.skill 仓库);含真名研究资料,整体不入库
# —— 去名化红线。仅放行两个【已验证无真名、且已随 .app 分发】的运行时文件,让 Windows 端
# 也能 pull 到 playbook。改这段务必先 `git check-ignore -v skills/lovehelper/<某带名文件>`
# 确认其余文件仍被忽略、`git add -n` 确认只暴露这两个。
skills/lovehelper/*
!skills/lovehelper/draftmate-adapter.md
!skills/lovehelper/relationship-copilot/
skills/lovehelper/relationship-copilot/*
!skills/lovehelper/relationship-copilot/references/
skills/lovehelper/relationship-copilot/references/*
!skills/lovehelper/relationship-copilot/references/human-progression-playbook.md

